{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326970/extras/CldqQY.gif?t=1742419636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the shadows of Earth's orbit, No\u00eblle, 18F, awakens aboard the ISS with fragmented memories and a burning desire for vengeance. Descending to Petaputua, a sprawling, neon-lit metropolis, she finds a city drenched in decadence and danger. Here, technology and humanity intertwine in ways both thrilling and forbidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Petaputua\u2019s streets are rife with vice and violence. Cybernetic thugs, seductive rogue AIs, and ruthless corporate enforcers dominate the city's underbelly. Each encounter pushes No\u00eblle to her limits, testing her skills and her resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326970/extras/IbJ3gB.png?t=1742419636\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this city of sin, power comes at a price. No\u00eblle must navigate a world of corrupt deals and illicit pleasures to gain the upper hand. Grinding for experience and gold is essential, with rewards that go beyond mere survival\u2014upgrading equipment, learning new, provocative skills, and indulging in the city's dark temptations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victor, the enigmatic antagonist, manipulates the chaos from the shadows. His true motives remain hidden, but his influence pervades every corner of Petaputua, driving No\u00eblle towards a confrontation that promises to be as intimate as it is deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326970/extras/2.pn